<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλό-φῡλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of another tribe, foreign,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; freq. in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i> of Philistines, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jd.</u>
				14.1
			</span></i>, al.; in Egypt, <i>settled in another nome</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				419.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀλλόφυλον . . χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					851
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.102
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				629d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα</span>”
				<i>alien to man, wild,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος ἀ.</span> war <i>with
				foreigners,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόφυλος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζαν ἐπ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>alien, not one's own,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					159.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
